From 72993ef1d551d6bb24ddbc7a9e92891d40a09dbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@local>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 16:29:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 083/180] Fix the actual EQ handle, restore Liquid's flower
 shape smaller and blurred

- The player-screen handle that opens the EQ (EqualizerHandle in
  Player.kt) was still 36dp - the earlier "enlarge the handle" fix
  targeted EqualizerPanelHandle, the different handle inside the panel
  once it's already open. That one is now closer to its original size
  instead of the 110dp it grew to.
- LiquidBackground: back to the spiky petal-crown shape rather than
  soft circles - the shape itself wasn't the problem, only its size and
  colour were. Kept smaller (0.20x the shorter screen dimension) and
  blurred (18dp) for softer edges, using the actual dominant/theme
  colour rather than a black-lerped tint, with the frame-accumulated,
  audio-energy-scaled clock from the previous fix so motion still reads
  as flowing rather than blinking.
---
