From fd90e1280934ef177a1e6c115ecc80caa186af3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@local>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 14:01:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 093/180] Size the artist header to the image's own shape, not
 a forced 4:3 crop

Artist images come in two real shapes: older channels have a square
avatar, newer ones a wide banner-style photo (sometimes letterboxed
with black bars baked into the picture itself). Requesting a fixed
1200x900 (4:3) crop regardless cost the square ones their top and
bottom and the wide ones their sides - both were being cropped to fit
a shape neither of them actually is.

naturalAspectRatioOrNull() (YouTubeUtils.kt) reads the true aspect
ratio straight off the CDN URL's own embedded size before any image is
requested or decoded - googleusercontent URLs embed real w/h, and
yt3.ggpht.com's =sSIZE scheme only ever serves square crops, which is
exactly the old-avatar case. The artist header box now takes on that
ratio (clamped to 0.9-2.2 so a stray unusual source can't blow the
header out), and requests the image at a fixed *width* only instead of
a fixed width+height, so resize() fills in a height that preserves
whatever shape the source actually has instead of cropping to one that
doesn't match it.

Fixed a real bug in resize() along the way: its single-dimension
branch computed the matching dimension as (requested / source) * source
- integer division truncated this to zero whenever the requested size
was smaller than the source's, and gave the wrong value otherwise
(e.g. asking for 1200 against a 544-wide source produced 1088, not
1200). Multiplying before dividing fixes it. Dead code until this
change, since every other resize() call already asked for both
dimensions explicitly.
---
 .../ui/screens/artist/ArtistScreen.kt         | 19 +++++++++--
 .../dd3boh/outertune/ui/utils/YouTubeUtils.kt | 32 +++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 47 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/ui/screens/artist/ArtistScreen.kt b/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/ui/screens/artist/ArtistScreen.kt
index 3a456f18..dffd3ead 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/ui/screens/artist/ArtistScreen.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/com/dd3boh/outertune/ui/screens/artist/ArtistScreen.kt
@@ -105,6 +105,7 @@ import com.dd3boh.outertune.ui.menu.YouTubePlaylistMenu
 import com.dd3boh.outertune.ui.menu.YouTubeSongMenu
 import com.dd3boh.outertune.ui.utils.backToMain
 import com.dd3boh.outertune.ui.utils.fadingEdge
+import com.dd3boh.outertune.ui.utils.naturalAspectRatioOrNull
 import com.dd3boh.outertune.ui.utils.resize
 import com.dd3boh.outertune.utils.rememberPreference
 import com.dd3boh.outertune.viewmodels.ArtistViewModel
@@ -159,17 +160,31 @@ fun ArtistScreen(
