From 32f5122eff7fb01003b693b6b884133fb4cf63c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <c@example.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 12:26:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 114/180] Keep every stream request under googlevideo's
