From 54d0de9476629ac569da945f577cfbb4bdfc132d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@local>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 10:10:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 135/180] Fix compressor settings reverting to default when
 picking a built-in EQ preset

Selecting any built-in preset (Rock, Pop, etc.) applied
EqualizerSettings.DEFAULT.withPresetGains(...), which carries default
CompressorSettings since presets are just band-gain arrays. That silently
discarded whatever compressor the user had dialed in every time they picked
an unsaved built-in preset. Now the current compressor is preserved unless
the profile being loaded is an explicitly Saved one, whose own compressor
should win.
