Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 09:33:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 161/180] Add a way to move already-downloaded songs to a new
 folder

Changing the external download folder in Settings has never actually
moved anything: swapping DownloadPathKey only changes where new downloads
and rescans look, and leaves every file already in the old folder orphaned
there. migrateDownloads() doesn't cover this either - it's a one-time
convert from the old internal ExoPlayer cache format to external files,
not a general folder-to-folder move.

